---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /fees-and-admissions/
title: Fees & Admissions
description: Clear fees for every stage of the IIHE Cambodia pathway, who can apply and how to start your application.
---
{% from "partials/macros.njk" import tbd %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Fees &amp; admissions</p>
    <h1 class="h1">Know the full pathway and cost before you begin</h1>
    <p class="lead">The International Institute of Higher Education (IIHE) Cambodia gives students and families a clear study plan from the first qualification to the final UK Bachelor’s degree stage.</p>
    <p class="lead">Study in Cambodia, pay by stage and avoid the cost of moving and living overseas.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book-a-consultation/">Book a free consultation</a>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary js-message" type="button">Message admissions</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="fees">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Fees</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Clear fees for every stage</h2>
      <p class="body-lg" style="margin-top:20px">{{ fees.note }}</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <table class="fee-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Payment stage</th><th scope="col">Current planned fee</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for row in fees.rows %}
          <tr><td>{{ row.stage }}</td><td>{{ row.amount | usd }}</td></tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
        <tfoot><tr><td>Total pathway</td><td>{{ fees.rows | sumFees | usd }}</td></tr></tfoot>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Who can apply</p>
      <h2 class="h2">There is more than one way to begin</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h4" style="margin-bottom:12px">Students with BAC II</h3><p>Direct entry to the NCC Education Level 3 Diploma with the Cambodian Diploma of Upper Secondary Education (BAC II): an average of 45% or more (grade D) in 5 subjects, including 45% or more in Maths, and in English if studied.</p></div>
      <div class="card top-graphite"><h3 class="h4" style="margin-bottom:0">Students with A Levels, IB or another recognised qualification</h3></div>
      <div class="card top-bluegrey"><h3 class="h4" style="margin-bottom:0">Adult learners with relevant qualifications or experience, subject to academic review</h3></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card top-graphite" style="margin-top:32px;max-width:860px">
      <p class="kicker">English requirement</p>
      <h3 class="h4" style="margin-bottom:12px">IELTS 4.5, or our free English placement test</h3>
      <p>Students whose first language is not English need an IELTS score of 4.5 or above, or an equivalent qualification. You do not need IELTS to start: you can take the free NCC Education Standard English Placement Test at IIHE Cambodia instead.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="body-lg" style="margin-top:32px;max-width:760px">We review your education documents and English level before enrolment so you start at the stage that fits your background.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How to apply</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Four simple steps</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>Book a free consultation at the campus or online.</li>
      <li>Bring or send your latest education documents.</li>
      <li>Show your IELTS result (4.5 or above, or equivalent), or take the free NCC Education Standard English Placement Test with us.</li>
      <li>Receive your recommended study plan, confirmed fee schedule and enrolment instructions.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{# Hidden until a date is entered in Settings → Contacts & next intake. #}
{% if site.intake.nextIntake %}
<section class="section bg-soft">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow is-red">Next intake</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Start your application</h2>
      <p class="body-lg" style="margin-top:20px">Book a consultation to confirm your starting stage and reserve your place.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="intake-card">
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Next intake</dt><dd>{{ tbd(site.intake.nextIntake) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Application deadline</dt><dd>{{ tbd(site.intake.deadline) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Class schedule</dt><dd>{{ tbd(site.intake.schedule) }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book-a-consultation/">Apply now</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="/book-a-consultation/">Book a free consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
